        "0x34"
      ],
      "draw_rule": "narrow_8x8",
      "nes_dispatch_note": "DrawBomb (Z_07.asm:4869) -> DrawCloud -> Anim_WriteItemSprites with item slot $01, frame 0 -> ItemFrameTiles[$03] = $34. Tile $34 in [$20,$62) -> @Narrow path (Z_01.asm:5288), single 8x8 sprite."
    },
    {
      "name": "explosion",
      "item": "explosion",
      "direction_class": "static",
      "nes_frame_tile": "0x70",
      "sprite_size": [
        2,
        1
      ],
      "tile_ids": [
        "0x70",
        "0x72",
        "0x74"
      ],
      "draw_rule": "mirrored_16x8_phase_cycle",
      "nes_dispatch_note": "DrawOtherBombClouds (Z_07.asm:4936) draws cloud cluster via DrawBombOrCloudNoFlashing -> Anim_WriteItemSprites with item slot $01, frames 1-3 -> ItemFrameTiles[$04..$06] = $70/$72/$74. Each tile in [$6C,$7C) -> @Wide -> Anim_WriteMirroredSpritePair (Z_01.asm:5304): 2 8x8 sprites side-by-side, right=left hflipped, total 16x8. Generator emits 2 Genesis tiles per NES tile (raw + hflipped) so SGDK SPRITE_SIZE(2,1) renders both halves."
    },
    {
